<title>INDIA: India's ITC 1st half 1996/97 results.</title>
<headline>India's ITC 1st half 1996/97 results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  1,808.0 vs  1,414.3</p>
<p>    Net sales	  13,650.7 vs 11,546.4</p>
<p>    Other income	  538.0 vs    340.0</p>
<p>    Expenditure	10,434.7 vs  8,946.8</p>
<p>    Interest		570.7 vs    391.0</p>
<p>    Gross profit	3,183.3 vs  2,548.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  268.1 vs    230.1</p>
<p>    Tax		   1,107.2 vs    904.2</p>
<p>NOTE: B.A.T. plc of the U.K. is the single largest shareholder in ITC Ltd, with a 31.7 percent stake of equity.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
